# final-combined-v2 (refined for sE/sT/sL toward 0.7–0.9)
# Evidence: final-combined 8192 → S=18.6, 115/300, p95 TPOT 87ms (worse than best
# Final S=19.1 / 127 / 82ms at ~2048). Cap 64 and MTP+explicit-APC both S=0.
# Target math: sE≈0.7 needs ~2.16× η ≈ 210–230 SLO-met at ~60kJ — ~2× today’s count.
# Binding miss is p95 TPOT at peak ~111 running. vLLM: smaller batched-token budget
# improves ITL/TPOT. Raise GPU mem for KV headroom. Keep APC on, MTP off, uncapped.
CMKL/MANGO1.5-Qwen3.5-9B-AWQ-W4A16-mtp
--host 0.0.0.0
--port 8000
--served-model-name mango1.5-awq-w4a16
--trust-remote-code
--gpu-memory-utilization 0.95
--max-model-len 40960
--enable-auto-tool-choice
--tool-call-parser qwen3_coder
--reasoning-parser qwen3
--enable-chunked-prefill
--max-num-batched-tokens 1024
--enable-prefix-caching
# --mamba-cache-mode align matches run5/profile.args.
# On vLLM 0.32.1rc1.dev361+g83c078d95, --mamba-cache-mode is deprecated and has no effect.
# Mamba prefix caching follows --enable-prefix-caching.
# flag-check may WARN that "align" is absent from that deprecation text. That WARN is expected.
--mamba-cache-mode align
